line":{"text":"贴着不同颜色的胶带。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-1b4","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1b4"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这是指示着红色,蓝色,绿色,\n所代表的是各科室所在的地方。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-218","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-218"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我沿着其中白色胶带的指示前进。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-27d","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-27d"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"走大概30米，就能在右手边看到一个商店，\n商店的对面是吸烟室。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-2ed","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-2ed"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"而左手边的，是外科候诊室。\n再去走廊的尽头，便有一部小电梯。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-367","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-367"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我搭上电梯…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-38e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-38e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"直接按下了最顶楼的按钮。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-419","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-419"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"叮，","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-4ac","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-4ac"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"７楼。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-4c9","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-4c9"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"出现在眼前的是护士站。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-500","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-500"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"护士们一同往这边看来。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-53f","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-53f"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"但是，确认是我后便转回了视线。\n好像什么都没看见一样，继续她们的工作。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-5bf","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-5bf"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…高高的天花板，仅能拉开15厘米的窗户。\n纯白、明亮又冰冷的地方。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-631","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-631"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我直接走向在尽头左手边的谈话室。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-6aa","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-6aa"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"那里摆着一台大电视和沙发。\n还有几朵花装饰在窗边。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-712","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-712"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"花瓶种植的迷你向日葵，感觉，像是在夏天一样\n盆栽种植着的非洲菊，也正鲜艳地开着。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-788","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-788"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…这些都是曾经看过的东西。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-7ed","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-7ed"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「再次来到这里…已经隔了多少年呢…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-828","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-828"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"和那时不同的，也只是我的穿着。\n从水手服变成睡衣，","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-898","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-898"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"以及腕上的手环，\n从蓝色变成白色而已。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-924","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-924"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"『你…』","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-947","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-947"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"听到声音后我回头一看，是位不认识的老婆婆。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-984","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-984"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"身上的睡衣和白色手环，\n代表着她也是这里的病人。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-9e8","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-9e8"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"『是来探病的？　还是其他楼层的病人？』","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-a5b","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-a5b"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…不是」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-a7c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-a7c"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我一边摇头，一边给她看我的手环。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-abf","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-abf"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"『啊…是这样啊…』","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-af2","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-af2"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"老婆婆像是触碰了不该触碰的话题一般地回应着。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-b27","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-b27"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"可以感觉到，这样的话语中，\n 隐含着“明明还这么年轻真是可怜”的感叹。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-b95","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-b95"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"当然，这种经历已经多到厌倦了。\n毕竟，10年的病程都是这么过来的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-c17","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-c17"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…只是没想到，\n即使是和我一样的7楼居民，也会用同情的目光看着我。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-ca7","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-ca7"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"『说起来…你","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-cc6","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-cc6"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…是第几次？』","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-d15","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-d15"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…是指什么？」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-d3e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-d3e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"『来这里…７楼』","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-d6f","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-d6f"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"一时间，我完全无法理解她想问什么。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-db6","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-db6"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"不过，在我反问她之前，","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-df7","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-df7"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"『看来是第一次呢』","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-e2a","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-e2a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"老婆婆似乎自说自话地找到了答案。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-e65","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-e65"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"『那么，也告诉你吧，要好好听哦』","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-eb4","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-eb4"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"「………………」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-efd","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-efd"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"『…首先，７楼这个地方…』","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-f36","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-f36"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"即使没有收到我的回应，老婆婆还是自顾自地继续说了下去。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-f83","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-f83"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…没有第4次。\n第3次进出院就是最后了，做好心理准备吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-fdf","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-fdf"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"想逃跑的话不要走Ａ车站，走Ｂ车站。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-1024","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1024"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"什么都不要吃…对家人来说负担最少。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-106f","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-106f"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"她这么跟我说了。\n除此之外也都是些让人绝望的内容。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-10dd","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-10dd"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"恐怕，这是只有７楼的居民们…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-1114","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1114"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"只有正靠近死亡的人们，才会“传承”下来的东西吧。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-1187","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1187"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"『怎么样？　记住了吗？』","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-11e0","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-11e0"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「…嗯」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-1201","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1201"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"老婆婆大致说明完了后。\n感觉气色变得比刚刚好点了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-1273","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1273"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"『嗯……对你这般年轻的孩子，　\n实在让人难以启齿…』","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-12d9","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-12d9"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"『但毕竟也是规则，再难也要告诉你』","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-131a","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-131a"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"说着这些，老婆婆走出谈话室。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-1361","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1361"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"离开的时候，『再有新人来的时候，就由你来告诉他这些事吧。』\n 老婆婆又带上这么一句。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-142b","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-142b"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"炽热的阳光和蝉鸣声。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-1458","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1458"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"从只能从打开１５ｃｍ的窗户中看到的夏空。\n看来今天也会很热呢。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-14c2","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-14c2"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…不知已经隔了多少年。\n不过这也是我第一次以“居民”的身份来到这里。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-1534","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1534"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…而且，传达给我的规则。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-1567","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1567"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"本来，是只有这里的居民\n才会被告知的吧…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-1640","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1640"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「不过…这当中有几条，我早就知道了…」","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-16c5","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-16c5"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"…也许从那天开始…","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01\",\"main\"]/mjo-16ec","target":{"variantId":"mjo/patches/narci_onetwo/%23mjo/nar2_01","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-16ec"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"就知道会有这一天…","speaker":"旁白"}}]}
